{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/Mik1.gif?t=1742642153\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waking up after an untold amount of time, you find yourself in the decaying remains of a vast, lifeless facility. Set in a <strong><i>Blame!</i>-esque</strong> world, you must navigate the depths of an <strong>abandoned megastructure</strong>\u2014a seemingly endless structure of ruins and corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through chained <strong>parkour</strong> movements, you traverse the crumbling infrastructure, exploring a desolate world long forgotten. But there is no one left to witness it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/KeyFeaturesBanner.png?t=1742642153\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark &amp; Mysterious <strong>atmosphere</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Narrative experience throughout a vast Megastructure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic <strong>parkour</strong> with <strong>environmental puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the past and piece together the mysterious <strong>lore</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful but optimised graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, Wallrun and Dash through the game...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">... or take it slow and enjoy the view </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2547010?t=1742642153","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742642153","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/29df23e4d3720751bdc78e81316e75c8495bf6d7/capsule_231x87.j